{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/00cf2ed7eb824788fdf426bd3097aceb.poster.avif?t=1761698038\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/00cf2ed7eb824788fdf426bd3097aceb.webm?t=1761698038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/30823630a059cd173507983a6273e233.poster.avif?t=1761698038\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/30823630a059cd173507983a6273e233.webm?t=1761698038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Escape from Slumberland is an online co-op horror game with up to 4 players. Dodge deadly traps, outwit fiendish monsters, and escape with enough moonbeams to sate an ancient evil\u2019s hunger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/36bae759e015de584193dc0286ae7cd6.poster.avif?t=1761698038\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/36bae759e015de584193dc0286ae7cd6.webm?t=1761698038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/469dbe91ea4b0ea16247778361dd654f.poster.avif?t=1761698038\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/469dbe91ea4b0ea16247778361dd654f.webm?t=1761698038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather toys from the dream realm  and grind them into moonbeams. Will you chicken out while you\u2019re ahead or venture deeper for secrets that could multiply your haul?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/efdcae595bbf8636d3c295344c25ae0c.poster.avif?t=1761698038\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/efdcae595bbf8636d3c295344c25ae0c.webm?t=1761698038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/ee14902afd9eb0fbcf3e723c10cefbf9.poster.avif?t=1761698038\" width=620 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/ee14902afd9eb0fbcf3e723c10cefbf9.webm?t=1761698038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your friends from beyond the grave by bestowing powerful blessings. It could be the difference between certain doom and a miraculous escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011520/extras/3c88e2b1db54